Use let for a value that will change. Use const for a value that should stay the same:
```javascript
let score = 1;
score = 2;
const pi = 3.14;
```

Jo value badlegi uske liye let use karo. Jo value same rehni chahiye uske liye const:
```javascript
let score = 1;
score = 2;
const pi = 3.14;
```

जो मान बदलेगा उसके लिए let इस्तेमाल कीजिए। जो मान वही रहना चाहिए उसके लिए const:
```javascript
let score = 1;
score = 2;
const pi = 3.14;
```

